# Manual/live test scripts that need real prod credentials or hit the real
# prod host (mint live JWTs via create_access_token + settings.JWT_SECRET,
# hardcode files.dunemachines.com, etc.) — these must never be committed.
# Name-matching on the old files (test_full_prod.py, test_stress.py,
# test_fixes_verification.py, test_security_audit.py) wouldn't have caught
# 3 of the 4 removed 2026-08-07, so the convention going forward is: any
# script like this lives under tests/manual/, which is ignored wholesale.
tests/manual/
